issuecomment-2777226103","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104988","id":2777226103,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6liRt3","user":{"login":"Mostafa808","id":69848104,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5ODQ4MTA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69848104?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mostafa808","html_url":"https://github.com/Mostafa808","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mostafa808/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mostafa808/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mostafa808/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mostafa808/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mostafa808/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mostafa808/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mostafa808/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mostafa808/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mostafa808/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-03T23:47:46Z","updated_at":"2025-04-03T23:47:46Z","body":"I assume I was confused by this statement at first:\n\n> By default, builds of Godot do not contain support for the Direct3D 12 graphics API.\n\nThe official builds are indeed compiled with d3d12 option. I thought otherwise because of \"**By default**\". I wish the engine would ignore this option and print a warning if compiled without d3d12. Maybe later.\nAnyway, thanks for your help! I appreciate it!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2777226103/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2777256668","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104988#issuecomment-2777256668","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104988","id":2777256668,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6liZLc","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-04T00:16:21Z","updated_at":"2025-04-04T00:17:35Z","body":"I still think the crash is unintended here, and it should fall back to Vulkan as D3D12 is not supported by the current build. We already have such fallback logic in place; we should make sure it's always used regardless of GPU support in builds that have D3D12 disabled at compile-time.\n\nThe automatic fallback will always print a message when it occurs, but maybe it's worth making an additional print in this case to state that the current build has D3D12 support disabled.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2777256668/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":3,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3063775930","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104988#issuecomment-3063775930","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104988","id":3063775930,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc62nYK6","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-11T20:47:34Z","updated_at":"2025-07-11T20:47:34Z","body":"I can still reproduce this on 4.5.beta https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/c6d130abd9188f313e6701d01a0ddd6ea32166a0 (Windows 11 24H2).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3063775930/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]